{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-architecture-storage-query","title":"持续剖析平台架构与存储检索设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-flamegraph-performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-platform-ops/platform-architecture-storage-query","wordCount":2525,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"持续剖析平台架构与存储检索设计\">持续剖析平台架构与存储检索设计</h1><p>把持续剖析从「一台机器上跑 <code>pprof</code>」推进到「全公司所有服务 7×24 采样」，难点会瞬间从「怎么采」变成「怎么存、怎么查、怎么在万亿级样本里只花几百毫秒捞出那一条退化路径」。一千个实例一天可产出约 864GB 原始剖面，若还沿用「每份剖面存三副本、放本地磁盘、查询时全量扫」，成本会在第二个季度失控。2025 年 Grafana 对 Pyroscope 的 2.0 重写，本质上就是一次围绕「对象存储是唯一真相源」的重构，它把写路径复制、本地磁盘、store-gateway 全部砍掉，符号存储量下降最高 95%（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/blog/2025/11/12/pyroscope-2-0-release/\">Grafana Pyroscope 2.0 发布说明</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个持续剖析平台要把「秒级采样、全量服务、跨月查询」同时做成，必须回答四个架构问题：<strong>写入放大多少、真相源在哪、读路径有没有状态、元数据怎么索引</strong>。指标与日志领域的两套成熟答案给出参照系——Prometheus/Mimir 走「本地块 + 远端复制 + 集中索引」，Loki 走「对象存储 + 集中索引」。剖面体积随<strong>栈深度 × 样本数</strong>增长，几乎必然选后者。</p>\n<p>平台由五类角色组成，理解职责边界比记组件名更重要：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>写入端</strong>：接收 SDK / eBPF agent 推送的剖面，做路由与去重，落成可长期存储的块。</li>\n<li><strong>存储层</strong>：对象存储（S3/GCS/Azure/文件系统等）作为唯一真相源，块按 service 与时间窗组织。</li>\n<li><strong>元数据索引</strong>：集中式登记「哪个 service 的哪段时间在哪个块里」，让读路径无需枚举全部对象。</li>\n<li><strong>查询层</strong>：无状态 querier 并行扇出、拉取、合并成火焰图，按需弹性扩缩。</li>\n<li><strong>合并层</strong>：后台 compaction 把小 segment 合并成大 block，同时完成符号字典去重。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[SDK / eBPF agent] --&gt; B[segment-writer&lt;br/&gt;每 500ms 切段]&#10;  B --&gt; C[(对象存储&lt;br/&gt;segment)]&#10;  C --&gt; D[compaction-worker&lt;br/&gt;按 service 合并去重]&#10;  D --&gt; E[(对象存储&lt;br/&gt;block)]&#10;  E --&gt; F[metastore 索引]&#10;  F --&gt; G[querier&lt;br/&gt;无状态扇出]&#10;  G --&gt; H[火焰图 / Diff]\">flowchart LR\n  A[SDK / eBPF agent] --&gt; B[segment-writer&lt;br/&gt;每 500ms 切段]\n  B --&gt; C[(对象存储&lt;br/&gt;segment)]\n  C --&gt; D[compaction-worker&lt;br/&gt;按 service 合并去重]\n  D --&gt; E[(对象存储&lt;br/&gt;block)]\n  E --&gt; F[metastore 索引]\n  F --&gt; G[querier&lt;br/&gt;无状态扇出]\n  G --&gt; H[火焰图 / Diff]</pre><p>两代架构的组件对照如下，这张表是后文两条线的骨架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>v1 角色</th>\n<th>v2 角色</th>\n<th>是否仍然存在</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>distributor</td>\n<td>一致性哈希 + 多副本分发</td>\n<td>按 service 路由（可省）</td>\n<td>简化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ingester</td>\n<td>内存 + 本地盘攒块</td>\n<td>被 segment-writer 取代</td>\n<td>移除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>store-gateway</td>\n<td>查询时从远端拉块</td>\n<td>读路径全无状态，直接扫对象存储</td>\n<td><strong>移除</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>compactor</td>\n<td>合并块</td>\n<td>compaction-worker，合并 segment→block</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>querier</td>\n<td>有状态，依赖本地块</td>\n<td>完全无状态，可弹性扩缩</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>metastore</td>\n<td>无（块靠本地索引）</td>\n<td>集中式索引：记录哪些剖面在哪些 block</td>\n<td>新增</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"写路径-从-复制三份-到-恰好写一次\">写路径：从「复制三份」到「恰好写一次」</h2><p>v1 时代的 Pyroscope、Parca 与早期 commercial 方案都沿用了「类 TSDB」的微服务模型：distributor 做一致性哈希把同一时间窗的剖面复制到多个 ingester，ingester 在本地磁盘攒块，store-gateway 在查询时把块从远端拉回。这套模型来自 Prometheus/Mimir 的指标世界，但剖面的体积形状让三副本复制成本远超指标场景。</p>\n<p>Pyroscope 2.0 把写路径压缩成一条直线：剖面按 service 路由后<strong>直接写入对象存储，每个剖面恰好写一次</strong>，不留任何内存 ingester 和本地磁盘（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/blog/2025/11/12/pyroscope-2-0-release/\">同上</a>）。segment-writer 无状态，默认每 <code>500ms</code> 切一个 segment 上传；后台 compaction-worker 负责把小 segment 合并成大 block。关键收益不在存储成本，而在<strong>运维复杂度</strong>：官方称升级窗口从 v1 的 8–12 小时降到分钟级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"块布局与符号去重\">块布局与符号去重</h2><p>对象存储成为真相源后，核心设计问题变成：<strong>怎么让「同一服务的剖面」物理相邻，从而让重复的字符串只存一次</strong>。Pyroscope 2.0 按 service 把同一时间窗的剖面聚进一个 block，块内对函数名、源文件路径、栈 trace 做字典去重。Grafana 自己的生产环境里，符号数据因此减少最多 95%（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/blog/2025/11/12/pyroscope-2-0-release/\">Grafana 发布说明</a>）。这个数字不神秘：一个服务几千个函数名，每条样本的栈都引用同一批名字，去重后重复率天然极高。</p>\n<p>v1 块的参数可作为理解布局的锚点（配置项名沿用至今）：<code>pyroscopedb.max_block_duration = 1h</code> 决定单块时间跨度，<code>pyroscopedb.row_group_target_size = 1342177280</code> 字节（约 1.25 GiB）决定单行组解压后大小上限，compaction 分 <code>1h / 2h / 8h</code> 三档逐级合并（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/latest/configure-server/reference-configuration-parameters/\">Pyroscope 配置参考</a>）。之所以按 <code>row_group</code> 而非整块读写，是因为查询几乎从不需要整块——它要的是「某 service 在某时间窗内 CPU 栈」这一个切片，行组是可跳过的裁剪单位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"元数据索引-metastore-与-label-模型\">元数据索引：metastore 与 label 模型</h2><p>读路径要无状态，前提是<strong>谁能回答「我要的数据在哪个 block 里」</strong>。v2 引入了 metastore——一个集中式索引，记录每个 block 覆盖的 service、时间范围和 label 集合。查询时 querier 先问 metastore 拿候选 block 列表，再并行去对象存储拉取，最后在内存里合并成火焰图。这与 Loki 的 index + chunk、Tempo 的 blocklist 是同一类思路：<strong>元数据小而热，放集中式；剖面字节大而冷，放对象存储</strong>。</p>\n<p>元数据本身需要治理。<code>metastore.index.cleanup_interval = 15m</code> 控制清理频率，<code>metastore.index.cleanup_grace_period = 6h</code> 给删除留出宽限期，避免把刚写入还没被查询引用到的索引记录误删（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/latest/configure-server/reference-configuration-parameters/\">配置参考</a>）。label 模型决定查询表达力：样本被打上 <code>service_name</code>、<code>namespace</code>、<code>pod</code>、<code>profile_type</code> 等 label，<code>SelectSeries</code>、<code>LabelNames</code>、<code>LabelValues</code> 就是围绕 label 集合做筛选。</p>\n<h2 id=\"读路径-无状态-querier-与扇出检索\">读路径：无状态 querier 与扇出检索</h2><p>扇出查询的成本可用一个式子描述。设候选 block 数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，单个 block 中被 label 过滤后仍需读取的字节数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，并行度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，则查询墙钟时间近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>P</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover><mfrac><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{query} \\approx \\frac{1}{P}\\sum_{i=1}^{B} \\frac{b_i}{R_{obj}} + T_{merge}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">bj</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{obj}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">bj</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是对象存储吞吐。这个式子解释了为什么<strong>行组裁剪和 label 索引比压缩算法更重要</strong>：压缩只降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的分子，而好的元数据索引能直接把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 从数千降到几个。它也解释了 <code>-querier.max-concurrent = 4</code> 与 <code>-query-scheduler.max-outstanding-requests-per-tenant = 100</code> 这类限流的必要性——超过 100 个排队请求的租户会被直接返回 HTTP 429（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/latest/configure-server/reference-configuration-parameters/\">配置参考</a>）。时间窗一旦超出热块边界，就必须回落到合并后的冷块，代价陡增；v1 用 <code>-querier.query-store-after = 4h</code> 划出这条线，v2 由 metastore 的块索引承担，但<strong>时间窗越宽、候选块越多</strong>的规律没有变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检索接口与查询语言\">检索接口与查询语言</h2><p>平台对外暴露两类接口：写入用 <code>POST /ingest</code> 或 gRPC <code>/push.v1.PusherService/Push</code>，读取用 Connect 风格的 <code>/querier.v1.QuerierService/</code> 系列方法（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/latest/reference-server-api/\">Pyroscope Server API</a>）。其中最有价值的是 <code>SelectMergeStacktraces</code>——它把时间窗内所有样本<strong>在服务端合并成一棵火焰图树</strong>再返回，客户端拿到的不是几十万条原始样本，而是一棵已聚合好的树。旧接口 <code>SelectMergeProfile</code>（返回原始 pprof）与 <code>SelectMergeSpanProfile</code>（按 trace 关联）已 deprecated，官方建议统一改用 <code>SelectMergeStacktraces</code> 加 <code>PROFILE_FORMAT_PPROF</code> 或 span selector。</p>\n<p>这套接口对电商类系统特别友好：订单服务在链路上注入 trace_id 后，运维可直接用 span selector 把「某个慢订单耗时的那 800ms 里 CPU 烧在哪」拉成火焰图，不必先知道是哪个 pod。与 <a href=\"../flamegraph-analysis-diff-workflow/differential-flamegraph-regression\">微分火焰图与回归定位</a> 中的 Diff 查询结合，平台就能回答「这次发布后哪个函数新增了热点」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采集侧的对接-alloy-与-otel-profiles\">采集侧的对接：Alloy 与 OTel Profiles</h2><p>平台不直接面对业务进程，中间隔一层采集器。Grafana Alloy 提供 <code>pyroscope.ebpf</code>（eBPF 无侵入采集）、<code>pyroscope.scrape</code>（HTTP 拉取）、<code>pyroscope.java</code>、<code>pyroscope.receive_http</code>、<code>pyroscope.enrich</code>（打标）与 <code>pyroscope.write</code>（转发）等组件，把采集与写入解耦（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/pyroscope/\">Alloy pyroscope 组件</a>）——后端换存储引擎时，采集侧配置可以不动。</p>\n<p>行业正在向 OTel Profiles 收敛：OTLP profiles 格式<strong>建立在 pprof protobuf 之上</strong>，补充了 Resource、InstrumentationScope、通用字典与属性单位，并允许样本携带 span ID 与 trace ID 以便与链路关联；<code>original_payload_format</code> 字段保留 <code>pprof</code>、<code>jfr</code>、<code>linux_perf</code> 三种原始来源以保证无损转换（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/profiles/\">OpenTelemetry Profiles 规范</a>）。但要认清成熟度：截至 2026 年该信号仍标记为 <strong>Alpha</strong>，相关愿景文档（OTEP 0212）停在规范 tag <code>v1.61.0</code>。因此现实策略是<strong>用 pprof 落盘、用 OTLP 做网关汇聚</strong>——两套格式的字段级对比见 <a href=\"../collector-symbolization-ebpf/collector-architecture-pprof-format\">采集器架构与 pprof / OTel Profiles 数据格式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"保留-压缩与租户治理\">保留、压缩与租户治理</h2><p>最后是三件在生产里一定会被问到的运营事。<strong>保留</strong>：v1 的容忍策略不是「保留 N 天」，而是<strong>基于空闲磁盘</strong>——<code>pyroscopedb.min_free_disk_gb = 10</code> 与 <code>min_disk_available_percentage = 0.05</code> 规定磁盘最少剩余 10GiB 或 5%，<code>enforcement_interval = 5m</code> 每 5 分钟检查一次（<a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/pyroscope/latest/configure-server/reference-configuration-parameters/\">配置参考</a>）。v2 的真相源在对象存储，保留策略更多交给 bucket lifecycle，但删除引入了一个<strong>延迟窗口</strong>：<code>compactor.deletion_delay = 12h</code>，块先被标记为待删，之后才真正移除，以容忍迟到的查询。</p>\n<p><strong>压缩</strong>：三档 compaction（1h→2h→8h）意味着数据在写入后几小时内会被重写多次，这既是符号去重的时机，也是<strong>写入放大</strong>的来源，对高吞吐租户要预留 compaction-worker 的 CPU 预算。<strong>租户隔离</strong>：每个租户的查询扇出带宽、待处理请求数、符号存储都必须分别计量；按租户设并发上限，才能防住「一个大租户的宽时间窗查询把对象存储读带宽打满」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>持续剖析平台的架构演进方向已经清晰：<strong>对象存储是唯一真相源，写路径写入一次，读路径完全无状态，元数据集中索引，剖面与符号按服务局部去重</strong>。选型时可用一张清单自检：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>写路径是否有多副本复制</strong>——应尽量避免，剖面体积让复制成本失控；写入一次是 2.0 的核心收益。</li>\n<li><strong>是否有本地磁盘状态</strong>——应尽量避免，它把升级窗口从分钟级拖回小时级。</li>\n<li><strong>读路径能否弹性扩缩</strong>——移除 store-gateway 后 querier 才能真正按查询量伸缩。</li>\n<li><strong>符号存储是否去重</strong>——同服务局部去重可带来最高 95% 的符号体积下降。</li>\n<li><strong>查询是否支持服务端合并</strong>——<code>SelectMergeStacktraces</code> 返回聚合后的树，而非原始样本流。</li>\n<li><strong>保留策略是否基于对象存储生命周期</strong>——v1 的「空余磁盘触发删除」应换成 bucket lifecycle。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这六项对齐，平台的成本和运维负担才会随规模线性而非超线性增长。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"持续剖析平台架构与存储检索设计","id":"持续剖析平台架构与存储检索设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"写路径：从「复制三份」到「恰好写一次」","id":"写路径-从-复制三份-到-恰好写一次"},{"level":2,"text":"块布局与符号去重","id":"块布局与符号去重"},{"level":2,"text":"元数据索引：metastore 与 label 模型","id":"元数据索引-metastore-与-label-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"读路径：无状态 querier 与扇出检索","id":"读路径-无状态-querier-与扇出检索"},{"level":2,"text":"检索接口与查询语言","id":"检索接口与查询语言"},{"level":2,"text":"采集侧的对接：Alloy 与 OTel Profiles","id":"采集侧的对接-alloy-与-otel-profiles"},{"level":2,"text":"保留、压缩与租户治理","id":"保留-压缩与租户治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多语言混合栈、off-CPU 与疑难根因实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-flamegraph-performance-engineering/flamegraph-analysis-diff-workflow/mixed-language-offcpu-root-cause"},"next":{"title":"生产采样策略、采集体量与成本治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-flamegraph-performance-engineering/continuous-profiling-platform-ops/production-sampling-strategy-cost"}}